KzDrO1iZo1uqPWyvxAQdEXZoZCcJUgG61ff9JTbQ&oe=6B0B2295"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 6.png", "id": "2011346012989071", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820980_2011346016322404_297963131427731231_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RgV_oRJiI2QQ7kNvwEntvaG&_nc_oc=AdqvgTlgB82nx4yi3dYoQtL5WtMcL89Fe-KVasVzAowASR3_F8OVnmltMHxLpI56KJs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRwRN5j0yIEXgqIQFl-PI9apnWiG17yKrH4Djya2WkXDg&oe=6B0B3447"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1512781303346635", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1512781306679968_8311265691607344888_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6pSmnVGsRK4Q7kNvwFKd_Cp&_nc_oc=AdpjOuz9SC7BA-kp3tXltFg3AWPIXJa1VzCEMZF3R_TYR0BOl5BQquJTr11Zx-pNa90&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRs3MkjMsIYr9X9ZfxauKPthbW6OAJ-TDVIjhCoXT6dWQ&oe=6B0B11CD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 copy.png", "id": "4351475101785831", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_4351475105119164_1853464437308931599_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YPVDUZBJ3R0Q7kNvwF4ykt0&_nc_oc=AdrPB1MOaa_Pi4NTDHDOrtIxdAaLvOurpyhxiTmO87KH0Fmp7UgmTmPlc41162v9wTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQi13sZIuYH6wG2Ta9NJlobsnXbFxiY0A1D-b6Pq0H3tA&oe=6B0B3B78"}, "display_name": "PutterVR", "keywords": ["golf"], "long_description": "# Lower Your Scores From Your Living Room\n**Free to try for 3 days.** Everything unlocked. Then one in-app purchase to keep playing. No subscription.\n\n**Three ways to play:**\n- **Launch Monitor:** putt a real ball - we read its true speed and line, then roll it out on a replica green with real break. Nothing to attach. Requires a putting mat or similar surface.\n- **Mixed Reality:** putt a virtual ball while still seeing your room and your feet (optional mount).\n- **Virtual Reality:** full immersion (optional mount).\n\nThe optional mount puts your controller on your own putter so the stroke is measured too.\n\n**Drills with a purpose.** Distance control, start line, aim, setup, pressure putting.\n\n**Championship courses.** 72 replica holes on greens from the courses the pros compete on every week.\n\n**Physics you can trust.** Tens of thousands of real ball data points - authentic skid, roll, break, and lip-outs. Dial in stimp to match your course.\n\n**Tour-level analytics.** Ball speed, line and miss patterns. Add the mount for face angle, path, tempo, smash factor and impact heat maps. In-headset, web, or mobile.\n\n**Every training aid built in.** Putting arc, alignment laser, tempo line, metronome, putting mirror, tee gates.\n\n**Play a friend.** 1v1 rounds and mini games over ranked multiplayer.\n\n**One price.** No pass, no season ticket, no renewals.\n\nQuestions? Chat with the dev team: https://discord.gg/2SbUnnpCfx", "short_description": "Real putter, real ball, every stroke measured. Putting practice on Meta Quest 3 with no subscription."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "3543613075811708", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_3543613082478374_638908712768740982_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wBS9eV8djCkQ7kNvwFYwOQp&_nc_oc=AdoK6M2A9c1dzHOz8Fp63kvMaS4SiRv59r62REw650vP3ai_fk4gPpyhijVD7gWZGEk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTZ4RcXbSbv_ksUUCWT65cPOzlTqZCmtZNw0YmEcpxPHg&oe=6B0B1AFA"}, {"file_name": "Korean Quest Store - 2560x1440.png", "id": "2026406291329707", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823837_2026406294663040_7189430179496047163_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dDTdeI64